      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Supply enters the cold aisle low and close to the rack faces; return is taken\nhigh, above the hot aisle, where the plume is hottest.",
      "originalText": "2. Supply enters the cold aisle low and close to the rack faces; return is taken high, above the hot aisle, where the plume is hottest.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 53,
      "versionNonce": 688361172,
      "index": "b14",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e289",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 861,
      "width": 581.2034486697808,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786302314591,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Delta-T across the row is the health metric. If return air is barely warmer\nthan supply, you are moving air around the equipment, not through it — and you are\npaying for all of it.",
      "originalText": "3. Delta-T across the row is the health metric. If return air is barely warmer than supply, you are moving air around the equipment, not through it — and you are paying for all of it.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "version": 43,
      "versionNonce": 2015131756,
      "index": "b15",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 1,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e290",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 913,
      "width": 588.4245373426074,
      "height": 30,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786302314591,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Fix in this order, cheapest first: blanking panels, grommets and cutout seals,\ntile placement, then containment. Only then buy tonnage.",
      "originalText": "4. Fix in this order, cheapest first: blanking panels, grommets and cutout seals, tile placement, then containment. Only then buy tonnage.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
